From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] certutil: hashfile, encode, decode, store verbs (3521)

certutil: -hashfile, -encode, -decode, -encodehex, -decodehex, -store, -addstore, -delstore

-hashfile prints MD2 to SHA512 digests; -encode and -decode do base64 with the certificate frame;
-encodehex and -decodehex use the offset and text layout (or bare bytes); -store lists the certificates of a
store; -addstore and -delstore change one through the Crypt32 store calls, so a machine store stays an
administrator's. Other verbs are refused with a message instead of silently succeeding.
---
